e such an unignorably Heroic Garou eventually the other Rank 6s will notice you, as they kind of form an old boys club of literally the Greatest Heroes alive, and they will come and test you to see if you are fit to join their ranks.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-31T04:47:07-07:00","id":1411189,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1410715-truly-legendary-heroes?p=1411188#post1411188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well they describe the Process of becoming Rank 6 in Revised. Basically when you are such an unignorably Heroic Garou eventually the other Rank 6s will notice you, as they kind of form an old boys club of literally the Greatest Heroes alive, and they will come and test you to see if you are fit to join their ranks.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>It is preserved in W20. But I think if you have achieved what I said above, then this process is no more than a ceremony","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theony